## Promises and policies

- Heartside sells to the US only. Shipping is free on every US order.
- Misprinted, damaged or wrong orders are refunded in full within 30 days of delivery, with no need to send anything back. Personalized items can't be returned for a change of mind: [refund policy]({{ agents.store_url }}/policies/refund-policy).
